{"ready":true,"data":{"id":"david-dastmalchian","name":"David Dastmalchian","birthDate":"1975-07-21","birthPlace":"Pennsylvania, USA","bio":"David Dastmalchian (/dəstˈmɑːltʃən/ dəst-MAHL-chən; born July 21, 1975) is an American actor, writer, and producer. He has had supporting roles in a number of superhero franchises: he portrayed Thomas Schiff in The Dark Knight (2008), Kurt and Veb in the Ant-Man franchise, Abra Kadabra in the CW's The Flash, and Polka-Dot Man in The Suicide Squad (2021).\n\nDastmalchian has appeared in three films directed by Denis Villeneuve: Prisoners (2013), Blade Runner 2049 (2017), and Dune (2021). Although he is best known for his work as a character actor, Dastmalchian had leading roles in the 2014 semi-autobiographical film Animals, which he wrote, and the 2023 horror film Late Night with the Devil, which he produced. He is also set to portray Mr. 3 in the Netflix series One Piece. He has a guest appearance on the 2025 TV Series Dexter: Resurrection.\n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article David Dastmalchian, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia.","source":"TMDB","fetchedAt":"2026-11-19T17:40:10+00:00","tmdbId":83854,"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/person/83854","credits":[{"id":"ant-man","title":"Ant-Man","character":"Kurt","characterFa":"کرت"},{"id":"antman-wasp","title":"Ant-Man and the Wasp","character":"Kurt","characterFa":"کرت"},{"id":"quantumania","title":"Ant-Man and the Wasp: Quantumania","character":"Veb (voice)","characterFa":"Veb (صدا)"}],"photo":"./public-data/images/people/david-dastmalchian.webp","filmography":[{"name":"Sender","year":2027,"character":"Charlie","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/aGZh3RUGAa0o9THmX4IEEmaIz8N.jpg","characterFa":"چارلی"},{"name":"The Shepherd","year":2027,"character":"The Shepherd","mediaType":"movie","poster":""},{"name":"The Cure","year":2026,"character":"Jeff Braun","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/